# ── Legacy WordPress URLs → closest new page (301 permanent) ─────────────
# The old WordPress site is retired. Point its still-indexed URLs at the
# nearest new page so Google / AI crawlers transfer ranking instead of hitting
# a soft-404. Verified against Google's live index (Aug 2026).
#
# Cloudflare Pages trailing-slash gotcha: a *literal* trailing-slash source
# ("/foo/") does NOT reliably match, and an unmatched trailing-slash request
# falls through to the SPA catch-all below — which serves the homepage. So each
# legacy path uses an exact rule for the no-slash form PLUS a "/*" splat that
# reliably covers the trailing slash (and any deeper old sub-path). The splat
# destinations are fixed URLs (no :splat token), so the wildcard-with-trailing-
# slash bug does not apply. None of these legacy prefixes overlap a real new
# route, so the splats are safe. All rules must sit ABOVE the SPA catch-all
# (first match wins). Old URLs whose path is identical to a new route (e.g.
# /services/orthodontics/, /services/same-day-smile/composite-bonding/) already
# resolve to the new page via the prerendered directory index, so no rule here.
/about-us                                     /about                                                     301
/about-us/*                                   /about                                                     301
/contact-us                                   /contact                                                   301
/contact-us/*                                 /contact                                                   301
/bruxism-tmj-and-sleep-apnoea                 /services/orthodontics/airway-and-functional-alignment     301
/bruxism-tmj-and-sleep-apnoea/*               /services/orthodontics/airway-and-functional-alignment     301
/services/zoom-teeth-whitening                /services/same-day-smile/zoom-whitening                    301
/services/zoom-teeth-whitening/*              /services/same-day-smile/zoom-whitening                    301
/services/cerec-single-visit-restoration      /services/same-day-smile/same-day-crowns                   301
/services/cerec-single-visit-restoration/*    /services/same-day-smile/same-day-crowns                   301
/services/aesthetic-dentistry                 /services/same-day-smile                                   301
/services/aesthetic-dentistry/*               /services/same-day-smile                                   301
/services/same-day-smile-make-overs           /services/same-day-smile                                   301
/services/same-day-smile-make-overs/*         /services/same-day-smile                                   301
/services/root-canal-treatment                /services/general-dentistry/root-canal-treatment           301
/services/root-canal-treatment/*              /services/general-dentistry/root-canal-treatment           301
/dentures                                     /services/dental-implants/implant-supported-overdentures   301
/dentures/*                                   /services/dental-implants/implant-supported-overdentures   301
/dentist-open-6-days                          /                                                          301
