# ── Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback ────────────────────────────────────────
# Serve index.html (200, not a redirect) for any path that isn't a real file,
# so client-side routes like /about and /services/... work on direct load and
# refresh. This is the Pages-native mechanism (Workers used wrangler.jsonc's
# not_found_handling instead).
/*    /index.html   200
